{"card_hash": "6c3679eaecc335ac39508f3a076937a20261583056eb1a5819100f51c772fb67", "channel": "MTS", "chars": 20490, "chars_all_clips": 20490, "chars_chosen_clips": 1440, "clip_count": 15, "clips": [{"deep_link": "https://x.com/MTSlive/status/2091252532689658001#t=0", "end": 81.979, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "4d35e5d13079006f48784ece173c41b746dd781db29bb78c2fb79e4614dbd744", "start": 0.08, "text": "I think about my job as an economist Yes, Claude is increasingly able to download data, run regressions, even build economic models And, you know, six months ago I might have thought to myself well I still have this comparative advantage at", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/MTSlive/status/2091252532689658001#t=139", "end": 256.672, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "76880377e70258f82f0f7aa3382123955bc9b3f01ca98743391bc60602098dd6", "start": 139.62, "text": "Moreover, diffusion within the economy I think it's like one in five firms in the US report using AI to some extent from the Business Trend and Outlook survey And so The diffusion within the economy has also accelerated And there's even som", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/MTSlive/status/2091252532689658001#t=513", "end": 631.779, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "7d24e26a41c64fddd1aa8e39a5b40e538888f942384cc487ec24a02b623fedaa", "start": 513.645, "text": "And we put out this report back in February or or January economic primitives where we compared task complexity on one axis against how successful the session was with Claude for our API users. So this is enterprise customers who are embedd", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/MTSlive/status/2091252532689658001#t=751", "end": 870.041, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "a2382e234bb8304959345b1de8b36d7964b526485897640a7e116f439f19a851", "start": 751.709, "text": "looking at the US economy in and trying to envision what the economy looked like 100 years ago you you would have a hard time really understanding what a large portion of what our jobs looks like Yeah exactly what you what you just suggeste", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/MTSlive/status/2091252532689658001#t=1056", "end": 1175.919, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "7bb4936025e909af4d5326d259f575b4adbb77bb4cf65dd6a30235ad8f48f066", "start": 1056.082, "text": "So, I thi- this is a really interesting question I think there are sort of two competing forces On the one hand you, have access to incredible scope with AI I don't know anything about building a website but Claude does I do know what maybe", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/MTSlive/status/2091252532689658001#t=1290", "end": 1410.22, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "e3adf34fe4416181e2908b6701e0cb9f9e1b72bd6fda48f830d0f96b38a70cc1", "start": 1290.488, "text": "in otherwise standard macroeconomic models you can generate things that look like infinite growth and finite time and I think understanding that dimension of let's say like the economic singularity or the prospect of the economic singularit", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}], "current_topic": "AI and ML", "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpts": [{"deep_link": "https://x.com/MTSlive/status/2091252532689658001#t=0", "end": 81.979, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "4d35e5d13079006f48784ece173c41b746dd781db29bb78c2fb79e4614dbd744", "start": 0.08, "text": "I think about my job as an economist Yes, Claude is increasingly able to download data, run regressions, even build economic models And, you know, six months ago I might have thought to myself well I still have this comparative advantage at", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/MTSlive/status/2091252532689658001#t=139", "end": 256.672, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "exc